            <fr:route>/def-0001/</fr:route>
            <fr:title text="Group">Group</fr:title>
            <fr:taxon>Definition</fr:taxon>
          </fr:frontmatter>
          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>
A <html:strong>group</html:strong> is a set <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[G]]></fr:tex> with a binary operation <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\circ ]]></fr:tex> satisfies the following properties:
<html:ul><html:li>Closure: <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\forall  a,b\in  G,a \circ  b\in  G]]></fr:tex></html:li>
<html:li>Associativity: <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\forall  a,b,c\in  G, (a\circ  b) \circ  c= a \circ  (b \circ  c)]]></fr:tex></html:li>
<html:li>Identity: <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\exists  e\in  G]]></fr:tex> such that <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\forall  g\in  G, g\circ  e=e\circ  g = g]]></fr:tex></html:li>
<html:li>Inverse: <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\forall  g\in  G,\exists  g^{-1}\in  G]]></fr:tex> such that <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[g\circ  g^{-1}=e]]></fr:tex></html:li></html:ul></html:p>
          </fr:mainmatter>
        </fr:tree>
      </fr:mainmatter>
    </fr:tree>
